  (text "J3 pins 1–2 report the stop to GPIO15. Pins 3–4 open Q1’s return.\nOpening J3 releases motor torque. VMOTOR and OUT2 remain live.\nUse J2 for higher current and connect only one input supply."
    (at 265 254 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "89c9a0a3-5910-40a2-966e-0a510e6f632a")
  )
  (text "D1 limits surges but clamps above the driver absolute maximum.\nSupply and motor regeneration must keep VMOTOR within its operating range."
    (at 290 133 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9b28f568-f452-4370-bbff-f7e59e199937")
